==Battleground==
*1 [[Project A]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Dolphina]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Dolphina]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage's difficulty drops dramatically after acquiring all of the [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] so if you struggle or don't want to risk wasting energy, getting more of them before attempting this stage is strongly recommended.

A possible strategy is to spam [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cats]] (while using combos to improve their stats) and time the [[Cat Cannon]] to allow the Dolphinas to stack. You will also need someone to outrange everyone. The idea is that the Dolphinas never hit the enemy they target, as they are always in blind spot, while Project A will have a hard time with the Rover Cats who are tanky and have the warp blocker ability. Frequent help from A. Bahamut is recommended. This strategy is partially luck-based, as getting the Rover Cats in place isn't easy.

Spawning [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Islands]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] when you have enough money is also a viable strategy.

==Trivia==
*The [[wikipedia:Chupacabra|Chupacabra]] is a legendary creature in the folklore of parts of the Americas, with its first purported sightings reported in Puerto Rico.

